2.15
  1
Authored 125 mm slab with central 600 mm wide, 300 mm deep thickening, sloped haunches, 200 mm internal wall, two T16 lower bars and T10 slab bars at 200 mm each way. Continuous 100 mm insulation follows the underside. Separate junction shows an original 300 mm taped DPM lap and a broad-base spacer, not a manufacturer-required lap specification.
